Theme: The colour tokens in crates/ui/src/theme.rs follow the DAW theme of
SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft, crates/ui-egui/src/theme.rs), licensed under
MIT OR Apache-2.0, with adjusted neutrals and StudioCraft's wine red accent.

App icon: assets/app-icon is original StudioCraft artwork (see its README).

Window frame: crates/ui uses craft-window from storytold/craft-libs (MIT OR
Apache-2.0) to decide per desktop whether StudioCraft draws its own title bar,
in which order the window buttons sit, and to make the bar move the window.

Windows packaging: packaging/windows (package.ps1, sign.ps1, studiocraft.wxs) and
apps/studiocraft/build.rs are adapted from SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft,
packaging/windows and apps/soundcraft/build.rs), licensed under Apache-2.0.

macOS packaging: packaging/macos (package.sh, import-cert.sh, Info.plist.in,
entitlements.plist) is adapted from SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft,
packaging/macos), licensed under Apache-2.0.

Linux packaging: packaging/linux/flatpak-bundle.sh, the Flatpak manifest and
postinst.sh are adapted from SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft, packaging/linux),
licensed under Apache-2.0.

FreeBSD packaging: packaging/freebsd/package.sh is adapted from SoundCraft
(storytold/soundcraft, packaging/freebsd), licensed under Apache-2.0.

Web build: apps/studiocraft-web (Trunk.toml, index.html) and packaging/web/package.sh
are adapted from SoundCraft (storytold/soundcraft, apps/soundcraft-web and
packaging/web), licensed under Apache-2.0.
